<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Supervised Learning - Tag - 三维象限</title><link>https://0make.top/tags/supervised-learning/</link><description>This is my new Hugo FixIt site</description><generator>Hugo 0.168.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>en</language><managingEditor>0make@gmail.com (AZ)</managingEditor><webMaster>0make@gmail.com (AZ)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:28:38 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://0make.top/tags/supervised-learning/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Supervised Learning</title><link>https://0make.top/resources/ai/sl/</link><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>0make@gmail.com (AZ)</author><guid>https://0make.top/resources/ai/sl/</guid><category domain="https://0make.top/categories/ai/">AI</category><description>&lt;p&gt;监督学习（Supervised Learning）是机器学习的三大核心范式之一（另外两个是无监督学习和强化学习）。它是目前应用最广泛、最成熟的机器学习方法。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="-什么是监督学习"&gt;&lt;span&gt;🎓 什么是监督学习？&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#-%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88%e6%98%af%e7%9b%91%e7%9d%a3%e5%ad%a6%e4%b9%a0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;监督学习&lt;/strong&gt;是一种机器学习方法，它使用&lt;strong&gt;已标记的数据集&lt;/strong&gt;来训练算法，让模型学习输入与输出之间的映射关系。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>